[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 14161.429, "timestamp": "03:56:01", "text": "你好。我……這看起來像……呃……Fibbeing，但更小一些。  是我最好的朋友和最值得信賴的夥伴。感謝你們幫助我們拯救"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14164.15, "timestamp": "03:56:04", "text": "精靈，趕走那些精靈"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14165.269, "timestamp": "03:56:05", "text": "獵人。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14168.15, "timestamp": "03:56:08", "text": "精靈"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14181.83, "timestamp": "03:56:21", "text": "獵人。  是的。後面那幾個傢伙。他們的名字聽起來一點也不酷。  我喜歡帽子上的配件。  他們能找到的每一個精靈。  看看那東西上的絲帶。  關於基因。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14183.99, "timestamp": "03:56:23", "text": "還有這個。這小傢伙太可愛了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14185.75, "timestamp": "03:56:25", "text": "各種各樣的物種。  看看那個"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14190.07, "timestamp": "03:56:30", "text": "像 zi 的東西。哦，瞧。就是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14193.14, "timestamp": "03:56:33", "text": "揮手。哇。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14194.63, "timestamp": "03:56:34", "text": "[音樂]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14195.75, "timestamp": "03:56:35", "text": "智慧。好的。  確切地。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14199.03, "timestamp": "03:56:39", "text": "你這麼快就明白了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14202.15, "timestamp": "03:56:42", "text": "你一定非常聰明。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14204.63, "timestamp": "03:56:44", "text": "總之，我在一本書裡讀到過，"}]